### Key Tips & Why They Matter for AI Agents

#### 1. Eliminate the "Optional Tweaks" Ambiguity
* **The Problem:** Your prompt lists "Tweaks A, B, C" like optional choices, but your top rule says `(ALWAYS IMPLEMENT ALL TWEAKS TOO)`. AI agents frequently get confused by this and either pick only one tweak or drop some core mechanics to "fit" the tweaks.
