#### 3. Give Exact Math & Tick Timings (Prevent Hallucinations)
* **The Problem:** Phrases like "enormous damage", "really big explosion", or "massive aura" cause agents to guess arbitrary numbers (e.g., 10 damage vs 1,000,000 damage, 5 blocks vs 50 blocks).
